{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1079854-2e-tribes-status","id":1079854,"title":"[2E] Tribes & Status","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-17T10:10:40-07:00","id":1079854,"title":"[2E] Tribes & Status","content":"Are there <i>Status ( Tribe ) </i>in 2E <b>WtF</b>? Cause I looked over in corebook and cannot find any reference to it.<br /> <br /> Is not Status in your Tribe a thing in Werewolf? Even if not in corebook - Where not some materials on titles or some perks from Tribe in 1E gameline?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-17T10:18:31-07:00","id":1079856,"title":"","content":"This seems like it could have gone in the simple question thread.<br /> <br /> Yes, it exists. It's probably less common because having esteem in a secret, world-wide organization is uncommon. It still happens, as fame travels.<br /> <br /> I don't believe first edition had any special titles among their tribes, since they're, like second edition, pretty disorganized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-17T11:24:13-07:00","id":1079894,"title":"","content":"None special Merits connected to Tribe Status? Beside Initiation to the Tribe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-17T11:55:57-07:00","id":1079911,"title":"","content":"No, you're free to add them if you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-17T20:44:43-07:00","id":1080168,"title":"","content":"My understanding is the Tribes don't have formal structures that you can earn Status in, and that the closest thing is members comparing each others' Renown.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-17T21:07:45-07:00","id":1080177,"title":"","content":"Yeah, but there is some knowledge to be had. Renown makes a great first impression but beyond that, werewolf is big on legends and stories travel.<br /> <br /> The Pillars, too, could help. They're described as 'the spine of the Tribes, providing leaders, chieftains, and visionaries.' Granted that involves aligning yourself with one of a Tribal Totems secondborn or 'lieutenant' spirits.<br /> <br /> Due to their lack of a formal structure you wouldn't have something like a special 'Tribal Status' or 'Auspice Status,' that would grant you access to special Tribal vaults or whatever, but just Status could be a thing. Rare, but a thing. Maxwell Roman probably warrants some among the Iron Masters, and Red Stick among the Predator Kings. Even if it isn't in their character sheets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-18-2017, 12:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-18T05:16:24-07:00","id":1080254,"title":"","content":"Werewolves are subject to Honorary Rank in which respects to at least 2 tenets of the Oath.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-18T05:36:23-07:00","id":1080263,"title":"","content":"I just use renown as the marker for Tribe status, really. I figure that's the intent, since you got a bonus against tribemates equal to renown in 1e, I think. Allies, contacts and mentor for specific Uratha, to represent connections to the tribe, and occasionally Fame (usually for characters who are known for something other than their deeds, like a prominent parent or maybe having Embodiment of the Firstborn)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}